{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0204_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5124072c5e05080d2dc75e256ec81fb960cc7467634dcaf40b66ef95d3c6591d", "ja": "（可憐達が出演するドラマの撮影が続いている。\n異種族達が主人公で、可憐はバニーポリス役だ）", "zh": "（可怜她们出演的电视剧还在继续拍摄。主角是不同种族的人们，而可怜饰演的是兔女郎警察。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0204_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "ef34abe85120456ce80ac6104bbb7109c993d0a1d5dd10783cf7a208721a33b3", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お、お疲れさまです……\nあの……わ、私の演技、どうでしたか……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦、辛苦了……\n那个……我、我的演技，怎么样呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0204_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "1be27e64d4c753e04212a8ee781745a8731b428e998b94e91519ab5fdb4e545f", "ja": "私、アクションとか得意じゃないので……れ、練習、\nがんばったんですけど……緊張、してしまって……。", "zh": "我……不太擅长动作戏之类的……所以，练、练习的时候，\n很努力了……但是……还是紧张了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0204_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "44a457172252b290638e7c7d028c2c15fe7b757d73c157ce644d6a33acf96e0f", "ja": "ど、どう、でしたか……？\nちゃんとカッコよく、できてましたか……？", "zh": "怎、怎么样……？\n我有好好地帅气地完成了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0204_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1ab5f0e1469ec4fd233f6de9166f906e40cf064839613606b17350d7f892a89f", "ja": "お疲れさま、可憐。うん、ちゃんとカッコよく\nアクションできてたよ。さすが、バニーポリスだな！", "zh": "辛苦了，可怜。嗯，你刚才的动作确实很帅气。真不愧是兔女郎警察！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0204_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "739d6d6d0bf62192f142eca0ee1fe586267cd60746896ce2a8ba1534a1f006c3", "ja": "ほ、本当ですか……？　よかった……♪\nあ……でも、ひとつ……き、気になることが……。", "zh": "真、真的吗……？太好了……♪\n啊……不过，有一件事……有、有点在意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0204_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f1bdd238bdf5b5536d85d9bf94d9249b91649a2d809019b5fe8448cfb267fb88", "ja": "気になる事？", "zh": "你在意的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0204_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "a4180be8db0273f85cc15876cd542e26d68b3dd529755068537083b8aaf1fc13", "ja": "はい……あの、犯人役の人たちが、言ってたんです。\n私になら、逮捕されてもいいって……。", "zh": "是……那个，饰演犯人的人们说过。\n他们说，如果是我的话，被逮捕也没关系……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0204_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "2af21f7e9c0b5111d559d14320f449571d3d226ddbdfbf6a61adb717859ed00e", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nそれって、どういう意味なんでしょう……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n那到底是什么意思呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0204_1009_p", "source_sha256": "3f17df49584f18d068e3af541422b3f633396969d7197d3448566ee31effcc1e", "ja": "そういう事か。逮捕されてもいいっていうのは、\n可憐が怖くないっていう意味じゃなくて……。", "zh": "原来是这样。说就算被逮捕也没关系，并不是因为不怕可怜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0204_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b919fe15655f4fbe707087b513c7764aba9f67c9f2eae635527a84612241e1bd", "ja": "そのくらい、可憐のバニーポリスが\n魅力的だった……って事じゃないかな？", "zh": "可怜的兔女警装扮魅力十足到这种程度……应该是这个意思吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0204_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "a7b1e421c999bc38c50cec7cc9825d36eac20a97db2eb86434c2459ec4968b28", "ja": "あ……そ、そうだったんですね……！　よかった……。\nじ、じゃあ、{$P$}さんも……。", "zh": "啊……原、原来是这样啊……！太好了……\n那、那么，{$P$}先生也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0204_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "c65bafebe0ce5e800e15631c6aa35b7b1bf150c8c368481870bb7e7e830b78e0", "ja": "私に……た、逮捕されたいって、\nお、思いますか……？　なんて……。", "zh": "你、你想被我……逮捕吗……？我是这么想的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0204_1013_p", "source_sha256": "508731aa8d2a61cfad3f102662b37d2e894f2f8655796a1e0749c339af2d908b", "ja": "そうだな、逮捕されるのは困るけど……\nでも可憐の事はいつでも信じてるし、頼りにしてるよ！", "zh": "是啊，被逮捕的话会很困扰……\n不过，我一直都相信可怜，也一直都依赖着你哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0204_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "92ec673ddd4480a761943b6c1c7cc0604c24ad9d188556d2bda82fe3ae00ae6e", "ja": "{$P$}さん……えへへ……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……嘿嘿……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0204_1015_045kar", "source_sha256": "9faf8263b090e2e457d82478074939927e61357bc341be836ae9f77a28085e03", "ja": "じ、じゃあ私……{$P$}さんが\n犯罪に巻き込まれないように、ま、守ります……！", "zh": "那、那我……会保护{$P$}先生，\n不让其卷入犯罪……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0204_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "c0a74c80cc1e89dfe77db7f48bd9f33a98ab8872d5b5c8e004cec03562133527", "ja": "凶悪犯罪を、未然に防ぐのも……わ、私たち、\nバニーポリスのお仕事です……なんて。てへ……♪", "zh": "防止凶恶犯罪发生也是……我、我们兔子警察的工作……什么的。嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0204_1017_p", "source_sha256": "f01a311dda7eaa5eba850d7c0182204f1639c7435e6b5979af8fd49beb62cc31", "ja": "（表情はいつもの照れた顔だけど、嬉しそうだ。\n今回の仕事、可憐の自信に繋がったな！）", "zh": "（虽然表情还是平时那副害羞的样子，但看起来很开心。看来这次的工作让可怜变得更有自信了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
